@startuml state-region
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
hide empty description
mainframe stm Freezing 영역 (FreezingRegion.state)

state NormalState
state NormalState : 규칙 그대로

state FrozenState
state FrozenState : beforeTransition() / holdSnapshot(board)
state FrozenState : afterGeneration() / --remaining

[*] --> NormalState : new FreezingRegion(area)

NormalState --> FrozenState : freeze(board, n, g) [n >= 1]\n/ 스냅샷 저장, remaining = n
FrozenState --> FrozenState : afterGeneration() [remaining > 0]
FrozenState --> NormalState : afterGeneration() [remaining <= 0]\n자동 해제
FrozenState --> NormalState : release()\n강제 해제, Clear, Load

note bottom of FrozenState
  예: 세대 10에 n = 5로 설치하면
  11~15세대 갱신 동안 고정,
  16세대 갱신부터 정상 규칙
end note
@enduml
